<<~ ahu #contract >>

!! Contract

`<$ahu>` renders a `<section data-lar-kind="ahu">` slot container, or in `carrier` render-mode, projects the slot body as raw wikitext. Supports reactive refresh on slot-fragment tiddler changes. Attribute: `slot`.

<<~/ahu >>

<<~ ahu #source >>

The code-file tiddler holds the source; this slot holds a WINDOW onto it, never a copy. One home
for the code — shipped by the plugin, or minted at promotion — and the anchor keeps the rope.

<$transclude $tiddler="lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/tw5/widgets/ahu" $mode="block"/>

